<p>Consider a landlord who owns a 12-unit complex in Houston. After a kitchen fire spreads to multiple units, the building suffers significant damage. Tenants are displaced, and repairs are estimated to take four months. The landlord’s initial claim is undervalued by $75,000 and does not include full coverage for lost rent.</p>
